审查以下代码是否有资源泄漏问题：

```java
public class FileProcessor {
    public String readFile(String path) throws IOException {
        FileInputStream fis = new FileInputStream(path);
        byte[] data = new byte[fis.available()];
        fis.read(data);
        return new String(data);
    }
}
```

